Date: Sun, 29 Nov 2026 03:02:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Solinear in-stream toolbar

A third overlay (top-centre): host screen buttons, FULL, GAME, MORE, END. Configured with the control
command 'toolbar <screens> <current>'; shown when the pointer reaches the top edge, hidden 2.5 s
after it leaves; clicks on it never reach the host and are reported as 'toolbar <action>' lines.
